<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 12.</title>
<headline>BULGARIAN NATIONAL BANK FIXINGS FOR JUNE 12.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bulgarian National Bank set</p>
<p>the following fixed exchange rates against the Bulgarian lev</p>
<p>for Thursday, June 12:</p>
<p>(Previous in brackets)</p>
<p>    USD  1,670.40 (1,667.70)	CHF  1,162.40 (1,156.50)</p>
<p>    DEM    973.99 (973.90)	  GBP  2,732.10 (2,731.70)</p>
<p>    ATS    138.40 (138.39)</p>
<p>Trading volume for Wednesday (total as dollar equivalent):</p>
<p>    Banks bought    $28.67 million</p>
<p>    Banks sold	$19.80 million</p>
<p>Total turnover  $48.47 million ($50.52 million)</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
